b_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716140/extras/611a3873641ea7d3932de43c0bed7a92.poster.avif?t=1705673328\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716140/extras/611a3873641ea7d3932de43c0bed7a92.webm?t=1705673328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716140/extras/611a3873641ea7d3932de43c0bed7a92.mp4?t=1705673328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "Enjoy your Winter Holidays with Milo and the Christmas Gift: a free-to-play, short but sweet point-and-click spin-off about our favourite little cat, Milo, who once again needs your assistance! But this time, Milo needs help finding one runaway Christmas Gift!",
